**Message 2 — Rename these env vars everywhere (Kubernetes secrets, local .env, CI/CD)**

```
OLD: NEXT_PUBLIC_AZURE_CLIENT_ID
NEW: AZURE_CLIENT_ID

OLD: NEXT_PUBLIC_AZURE_TENANT_ID
NEW: AZURE_TENANT_ID
```

> These no longer need the `NEXT_PUBLIC_` prefix. Kubernetes can now inject them at runtime like any other server-side variable.

